{"version":1,"content":"<p>一個名為nxnative的新開源項目，能把玩家自有的Switch遊戲轉換為iPhone和iPad上的原生應用。整個過程不涉及模擬器：每款遊戲的原始代碼直接運行在蘋果晶片上。同一套流程還可以生成Mac應用。《塞爾達傳説：王國之淚》如今能以獨立應用的形式，帶着圖標出現在iPhone主屏幕上。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583952.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T18:20:11.352561+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T18:00:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T18:18:07.616479+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T18:18:07.616479+00:00","content_hash":"54e2dab115dd37a1b4a2ee8aa884ea882c95fc4de9e1e2170c9937b6eba5a503","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}